WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.210
- So you're commentating

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.120
with Olympic figure skater, Johnny Weir

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.310
and your outfit coordination is on point.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.300
I love y'all,

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.760
you're both there for
it so, I'm just saying.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.013
- Really understated, right?

00:00:12.013 --> 00:00:14.706
Very understated.
- Exactly, exactly.

00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:17.500
Subtle.
- But we have the best time.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.490
We like to match, we like to coordinate,

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.720
it's figure skating, we
gotta bring the sparkle,

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.870
we gotta bring the drama so

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.220
and he's my best friend
so it's double the fun.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.220
- I love that.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.220
That's so fun to get to
work with like a best friend

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.110
and like, just have fun
while you're working.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.590
So you guys also find ways
to stay competitive though,

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:34.823
right behind the scenes?

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.430
- Yeah, it's still an athlete at heart.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.780
We'll we have a telestrator

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.340
that's new to our booth this year.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.683
So we'll play game on that.

00:00:42.683 --> 00:00:43.570
(laughing)

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.403
We'll figure things out.

00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:46.630
We also always share adjoining rooms

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.933
when we're at the Olympics.

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:49.880
So after the events

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.630
and when we're figuring out
our outfits for the next day

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.790
or having dinner, we get to be so close.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:57.760
So it's really special.
- I love that.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:58.840
- Obviously, I love what I do,

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.260
I love being part of figure skating,

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.220
but doing it with Johnny,
sitting to my best friend

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.920
it just makes it so much more fun.

